  "description": "Shim Tae-Woo, who became the lover of a chaebol playboy thanks to his pretty looks and submissive personality, is suddenly kidnapped by someone at a hotel and sent to a butcher shop called \"Jangsaeng Livestock\". The shop's owner, Gu Ja-Heon, takes in Tae-Woo, caught up in the conspiracy. Tae-Woo accepts this situation and gradually comes to rely on Ja-Heon.\n\nHe has no idea whatsoever what purpose his abduction serves.\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
